<title>USA: LPC - Banner Aerospace taps Citibank for $189.5 mln.</title>
<headline>LPC - Banner Aerospace taps Citibank for $189.5 mln.</headline>
<text>
<p>NEW YORK, Nov 13 (LPC) - Agent and arranger Citibank on November 7 launched syndication of a $189.5 million bank loan for Banner Aerospace Inc, market sources said.</p>
<p>The loan will be used for general corporate purposes, sources added.</p>
<p>The loan is split between a $71.5 million revolving credit and a $48 million A term loan (both five years); a $30 million, seven-year B term loan and a $40 million, six-year C term loan, sources said.</p>
<p>-- Beth Harmen, LPC Editorial, 212 489 5455</p>
